# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Without this, the app still works fully offline/local -- Google Drive sync
# (the "Connect Google Drive" button) is simply hidden until it is set.

# OAuth *Web application* client ID from Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services
# > Credentials. The project needs the Google Drive API enabled and the
# https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.appdata scope, and this site's origin
# (e.g. http://localhost:5173) under Authorized JavaScript origins.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
